      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'PLANETONIC


    Dear Applicant,


    We have received your information
    and we are pleased to announce that you have been selected as a date-assistant
    Chaperon in our government funded matchmaking program! We will send you the details
    of your position shortly via SMS. If you agree to our terms and decide to work
    with us, we will be assigning you a studio apartment in one the LunarDream space
    stations. If you want to go through your options now or simply want to learn
    more about us, you can visit our website below:



    https://planetonicmatchmaking.gov



'
