  m_text: "VOXTEK\r\n\nHappy Holidays from Voxtek!\r\n\nWe know you\u2019ll be working
    very long and hard shifts this holiday season, so to cheer you up, we\u2019ve
    put some new items on sale that you can use your hard-earned wages on.\r\nWe
    know it\u2019s tough to be away from your family and friends but hopefully spending
    a bit of money will help fill that empty spot inside your soul.\r\n\nVoxtek.
    Trust us. With your holiday shopping.\r\n\n(No Refunds)\r\n\n-Ethan\r\n"
