  m_text: "PURSUIT FURSUIT\r\n\nMeoooowwwwww, hewwo there fellow furry! We have renewed
    our stocks for fox tail plugs and kitty ears OwO! You can also now order your
    custom suits to have fully functioning \u2018openings\u2019 woof woof. Place
    in your order now and get a muzzle for free, hehehe ^w^ Have a meowtiful day
    and stay frosty baby!\r\n\nhttps://pursuitfursuit.net \r\n"
